#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:2
msgid "Abandoned projects policy"
msgstr "废弃项目政策"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:4
msgid ""
"This policy describes the process by which a Read the Docs project "
":term:`slug` may be changed."
msgstr "本政策描述 Read the Docs 项目 :term:`slug` 可被变更的流程。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:6
msgid ""
"If you want to de-list a project's fork from search results, please see :doc"
":`/unofficial-projects`."
msgstr "若你想将某项目的 fork 从搜索结果中移除，请参阅 :doc:`/unofficial-projects` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:9
msgid "Rationale"
msgstr "制定依据"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:11
msgid ""
"Conflict between the current use of the name and a different suggested use "
"of the same name occasionally arise.  This document aims to provide general "
"guidelines for solving the most typical cases of such conflicts."
msgstr "名称的现有使用与对同一名称的其他建议用途之间，偶尔会产生冲突。本文档旨在为解决此类冲突最典型的情况提供通用准则。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:16
msgid "Specification"
msgstr "具体规定"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:18
msgid ""
"The main idea behind this policy is that Read the Docs serves the community."
"  Every user is invited to upload content under the Terms of Use, "
"understanding that it is at the sole risk of the user."
msgstr "本政策背后的核心思想是：Read the Docs 服务于社区。每位用户都受使用条款邀请上传内容，并理解这完全由用户自行承担风险。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:22
msgid ""
"While Read the Docs is not a backup service, the core team of Read the Docs "
"does their best to keep that content accessible indefinitely in its "
"published form. However, in certain edge cases the greater community's needs"
" might outweigh the individual's expectation of ownership of a project name."
msgstr ""
"虽然 Read the Docs "
"并非备份服务，但其核心团队会尽力让这些内容以已发布的形式长期可访问。然而在某些边缘情况下，更广泛的社区需求可能优先于个人对项目名称所有权的期待。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:27
msgid "The use cases covered by this policy are:"
msgstr "本政策涵盖的使用场景有："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:29
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:55
msgid "Abandoned projects"
msgstr "废弃项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:30
msgid ""
"Renaming a project so that the original project name can be used by a "
"different project"
msgstr "重命名项目，使原项目名可被另一个项目使用"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:33
msgid "Active projects"
msgstr "活跃项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:34
msgid "Resolving disputes over a name"
msgstr "解决名称争议"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:37
msgid "Implementation"
msgstr "实施"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:40
msgid "Reachability"
msgstr "可联系性"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:42
msgid ""
"The user of Read the Docs is solely responsible for being reachable by the "
"core team for matters concerning projects that the user owns. In every case "
"where contacting the user is necessary, the core team will try to do so, "
"using the following means of contact:"
msgstr "Read the Docs 用户应自行负责就其拥有的项目相关事宜能被核心团队联系到。凡需联系用户的情形，核心团队都会尝试通过以下方式联系："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:47
msgid "E-mail address on file in the user's profile"
msgstr "用户资料中登记的邮箱地址"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:48
msgid "E-mail addresses found in the given project's documentation"
msgstr "该项目文档中找到的邮箱地址"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:49
msgid "E-mail address on the project's home page"
msgstr "项目主页上的邮箱地址"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:51
msgid ""
"The core team will stop trying to reach the user after six weeks and the "
"user will be considered *unreachable*."
msgstr "核心团队将在六周后停止尝试联系，该用户将被视为*无法联系* 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:57
msgid "A project is considered *abandoned* when ALL of the following are met:"
msgstr "当满足以下**全部** 条件时，项目被视为*废弃* ："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:59
msgid "Owner is unreachable (see `Reachability`_)"
msgstr "所有者无法联系（见 `Reachability`_ ）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:60
msgid ""
"The project has no proper documentation being served (no successful builds) "
"or does not have any releases within the past twelve months"
msgstr "项目没有正常提供的文档（无成功构建），或过去十二个月内没有任何发布"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:62
msgid ""
"No activity from the owner on the project's home page (or no home page "
"found)."
msgstr "所有者未在项目主页上有任何活动（或未找到主页）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:65
msgid "All other projects are considered *active*."
msgstr "其他所有项目均视为*活跃* 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:68
msgid "Renaming of an abandoned project"
msgstr "废弃项目的重命名"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:70
msgid "Projects are never renamed solely on the basis of abandonment."
msgstr "项目绝不会仅因被废弃而重命名。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:72
msgid ""
"An *abandoned* project can be renamed (by appending ``-abandoned`` and a "
"uniquifying integer if needed) for purposes of reusing the name when ALL of "
"the following are met:"
msgstr "当满足以下**全部** 条件时，*废弃* 项目可被重命名（追加 ``-abandoned`` 及必要的唯一化整数），以便复用该名称："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:76
msgid "The project has been determined *abandoned* by the rules described above"
msgstr "项目已依据上述规则被判定为*废弃*"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:77
msgid ""
"The candidate is able to demonstrate their own failed attempts to contact "
"the existing owner"
msgstr "申请者能证明自己曾尝试联系现有所有者但未果"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:79
msgid ""
"The candidate is able to demonstrate that the project suggested to reuse the"
" name already exists and meets notability requirements"
msgstr "申请者能证明拟复用名称的项目已经存在且满足知名度要求"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:81
msgid ""
"The candidate is able to demonstrate why a fork under a different name is "
"not an acceptable workaround"
msgstr "申请者能说明为何以其他名称 fork 不是可接受的变通方案"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:83
msgid "The project has fewer than 100 monthly pageviews"
msgstr "该项目的月浏览量少于 100 次"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:84
msgid "The core team does not have any additional reservations."
msgstr "核心团队没有其他顾虑。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:88
msgid "Reporting an abandoned project"
msgstr "报告废弃项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:90
msgid ""
"You can report an abandoned project according to this policy by contacting "
"our :doc:`/support`."
msgstr "你可以依据本政策，通过联系我们的 :doc:`/support` 报告废弃项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:92
msgid "Please include the following information:"
msgstr "请包含以下信息："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:112
msgid "Name conflict resolution for active projects"
msgstr "活跃项目的名称冲突解决"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:114
msgid ""
"The core team of Read the Docs are not arbiters in disputes around *active* "
"projects. The core team recommends users to get in touch with each other and"
" solve the issue by respectful communication."
msgstr "Read the Docs 核心团队不充当*活跃* 项目争议的仲裁者。核心团队建议用户相互联系，以尊重的方式解决争议。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:119
msgid "Prior art"
msgstr "先例"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/abandoned-projects.rst:121
msgid ""
"The Python Package Index (PyPI) policy for claiming abandoned packages "
"(`PEP-0541 <https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0541>`_) heavily influenced "
"this policy."
msgstr ""
"Python 包索引（PyPI）关于认领废弃包的政策（`PEP-0541 "
"<https://www.python.org/dev/peps/pep-0541>`_ ）对本政策影响深远。"

